Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.16,0:00:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, it doesn't look like\Nanyone's trying to tail us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucerati, shouldn't we be leaving Venice?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.02,0:00:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss commands a convoy of bodyguards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.86,0:00:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Chances are they already know\Nabout our betraying the Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.24,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The next threat will likely turn\Nout to be someone from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The worst part is, we have no idea\Nwhat kind of torture they can dole out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.61,0:00:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's far too risky for our band\Nof defectors to take to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, we observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.34,0:00:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Feed us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.87,0:00:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My guts are free!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the hold-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the food?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.18,0:00:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.98,0:01:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to ask this right now, but do you\Nthink we have time to drop by a restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.54,0:01:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.66,0:01:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We should all fill our goat sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.22,0:01:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.76,0:02:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.24,0:02:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.94,0:02:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I was thinking, people that\Nare vegan, do they eat cheese?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Or does it, like, go against\None of their rules or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.52,0:02:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm pretty positive that they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.94,0:03:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Products like milk and eggs come\Nfrom cows and chickens, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you put milk in a cake,\Nthat's a Naoko as well. Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.22,0:03:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They have to swear off cake too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.86,0:03:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if all that health crap\Nreally makes any difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.08,0:03:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So nothing from animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.66,0:03:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do they do\Nabout shoes or handbags?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.12,0:03:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All of that stuff is made\Nfrom leather, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, they're vegan because\Nthey feel bad for the animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.78,0:03:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They wear sneakers and carry\Naround backpacks instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.70,0:03:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.04,0:03:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They take this stuff so seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.40,0:03:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So are there a bunch of vegan grannies\Nout there dressed like ballplayers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.60,0:03:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Giorno, fear won't do us any favors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.12,0:03:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to relax and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.62,0:03:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'll try to. But we\Nall need to remain vigilant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If not, someone could\Neasily poison our food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.44,0:03:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.80,0:03:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell are you doing,\Nyou spindly little shit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.64,0:03:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.60,0:03:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm gonna let\Nyou get away with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.32,0:03:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This stain is gonna cost you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My suit cost four million lira, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.26,0:03:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm gonna make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're our next foe! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.42,0:04:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.48,0:04:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You trying to start trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.36,0:04:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that, Katsune! And this! And this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.90,0:04:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And one of these!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pump the brakes for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think this guy's an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.06,0:04:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.78,0:04:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A random citizen. Go figure. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit, what am I gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.80,0:04:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sucks for you, but this\Nstain's not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.08,0:04:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that's what happens when you mess\Nup and spill red wine on a white suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.09,0:04:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I can pay for something this fancy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.40,0:04:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Putting a button there\Nshould cover it up nicely,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.54,0:04:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,so good thing for you\Nthe stain is where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.00,0:04:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we let this guy go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.58,0:04:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have them taste our food for poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, we don't have\Ntime to mess around now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's not right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.66,0:04:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world is\Ngoing on with Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.66,0:05:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no question about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,His heart was stopped after\Nhis battle with the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.96,0:05:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And when he pierced his hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.42,0:05:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a single drop of blood\Nseeped from the wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.44,0:05:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole thing is so confusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But this really isn't\Nthe time to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.30,0:05:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,gate, since it's still just a feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.86,0:05:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Letting the others know\Nwouldn't do any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.08,0:05:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.40,0:05:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do from here on out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.74,0:05:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss possesses the\Npower to obliterate time,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.98,0:05:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and only he can move when his ability
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.94,0:05:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,is activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.85,0:05:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He is unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.77,0:05:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter the person or the approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.60,0:05:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,His stand
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,is so powerful, attacks\Nhave no effect in the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.33,0:05:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All bets are off once\Nwe unveil his identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.36,0:05:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,After we finally figure\Nout who the boss really is,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,we can eliminate him once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be tough, but we've no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.42,0:05:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kill or be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with you, but how the\Nhell are we gonna find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss has made extra certain to\Nremove any trace of his life till now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Trish?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely we can learn something useful\Nfrom her, given how involved she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.04,0:06:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think about how those goons\Nand the boss came after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.18,0:06:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.96,0:06:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.00,0:06:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.48,0:06:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already involved\NTrish enough in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.94,0:06:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It just doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.34,0:06:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish is the true victim here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.44,0:06:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing her own father tried to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.78,0:06:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Think how she must be feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a heart, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Involving her in the hunt for the boss\Nand his secret identity is the wrong move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.30,0:06:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.70,0:06:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's okay, Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've known all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.74,0:06:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,About the kind of man he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.86,0:06:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:06:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,T. Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.56,0:06:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, your talk of him leaving\Nno trace sparked something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.08,0:07:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I wondered about my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So I asked Mom, and she said\Nshe met him in Sardinia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sardinia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.00,0:07:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was little, Mom told a story\Nthat was very strange to me at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.82,0:07:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They met while she was on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.18,0:07:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, he went to run an errand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But he vanished and left nothing behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.40,0:07:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even his real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.04,0:07:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That must have been right\Nbefore he became the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.58,0:07:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That far back, do you think\Nit could be his hometown?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.86,0:07:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.88,0:07:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But, it's somewhere to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.14,0:07:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sardinia holds the key\Nto his past and identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.24,0:07:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what telling us that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.90,0:07:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We very well might end up\Nkilling your biological father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.08,0:07:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we'll do all we can to bring him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, whether your group decides to\Nkill him or not is your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing I want to know,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.44,0:07:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's whose blood is\Ncoursing through my veins!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.48,0:08:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be damned if someone kills\Nme before I get an answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.74,0:08:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that, Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.54,0:08:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This girl standing before us is way\Ntougher than you thought she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.56,0:08:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sardinia...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.84,0:08:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where we're heading\Nafter we escape this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's where we'll find out\Nwho the boss really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.24,0:08:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I was projecting too much onto\NTrish and totally missed the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's clear she's already\Nfound her Determinazione.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.36,0:08:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But given that I decided to join\Nthis suicide mission on a whim,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going into this thing with\Nmore doubt than hope for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.42,0:09:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, uh, guys, we've got company!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My soup's got a weird\Nshark swimming in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Lil' Bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.36,0:09:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Get Trish inside the turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.76,0:09:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Habakio, guard right! Mista, left!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.34,0:09:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.48,0:09:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we being attacked from?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside the soup bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.64,0:09:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how it got in there, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.62,0:09:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.42,0:09:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.04,0:10:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear there was some\Nshark-looking thing in my soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.90,0:10:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.81,0:10:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.73,0:10:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not seeing anything strange here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we lose the thing already?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.84,0:10:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.64,0:10:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.55,0:10:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you screaming about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Did that shark bite you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.28,0:10:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can help. Talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.46,0:10:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to help, but\Nyou gotta answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a moment, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.78,0:10:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia may not be able to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.74,0:10:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you really lost your voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:10:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Narancia?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:11:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what are you pointing at?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You want a drink of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.14,0:11:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, we're gonna\Nneed some help over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, his tongue has been\Nripped right out of his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he's breathing either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.48,0:11:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can make a replacement for\Nhis tongue using Golden Wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but it'll take a little time to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.42,0:11:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.46,0:11:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see that Naranj\Nis about to suffocate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.96,0:11:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, do you have a pen on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.66,0:11:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.57,0:11:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's right here, but\Nwhat do you need it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, that was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.46,0:11:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll imbue the pen with life force\Nand create the replacement tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.90,0:12:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, he'll be able to\Nbreathe through the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It all makes sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.46,0:12:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Giorno Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.32,0:12:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is very interesting indeed, and\Nit explains the boss's intel reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.68,0:12:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So the greatest threat to the Family\Ncomes from this cannoli-haired,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,deadbeat newcomer. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to admit, the brat keeping\NNarancia alive was a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.78,0:12:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Never in my wildest dreams\Nwould I have imagined Crush
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.98,0:12:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,having any trouble with this\Nparticular assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.68,0:12:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But apparently killing all\Nfive of these reprobates
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,will necessitate your\Ninvolvement as well, Tiziano.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.72,0:12:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As the boss's elite guard, it is our duty\Nto ensure these turncoats perish here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to do what\Nmust be done, Squalo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.80,0:12:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even need to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.02,0:12:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I lure them into the water,\NCrush will be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.78,0:12:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Our plan will decide everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.94,0:12:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's offer them one by one, Tiziano.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.80,0:13:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Gladly, Squalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.32,0:13:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And our friend Narancia is going to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.08,0:13:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright, Narancia? I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.12,0:13:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What info can you give us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.62,0:13:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.74,0:13:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How does their stand work?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It was in the soup bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.78,0:13:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.76,0:13:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, try to relax.\NI'm fine. I can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.22,0:13:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, help us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.66,0:13:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What does the enemy look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.30,0:13:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He was...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.91,0:13:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He was really small, like a huge pebble!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.46,0:13:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And he ran into the\Nback of the restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.14,0:13:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It was crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.34,0:13:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.25,0:13:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How can a pebble be huge?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.28,0:13:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you saying just a few minutes\Nago that you found it in your soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.12,0:13:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.14,0:13:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't really say that, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.68,0:13:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, answer this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.34,0:14:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you say our foe's\Nabout yay, Big? Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Then would you say it's about this, Big?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bigger, so you're saying\Nit's something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.56,0:14:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So this big-ass enemy was\Ntaking a dip in your bowl,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.80,0:14:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,then they just ran off into\Nthe restaurant and vanished?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.88,0:14:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.30,0:14:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but we're not quite understanding\Nthe picture you're trying to paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.46,0:14:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,they move at extremely high speeds? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They're as slow as you can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.34,0:14:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.76,0:14:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If it was as huge and slow as you\Nsay, then why didn't we see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you really saw Stan Narancia?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.26,0:14:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not see one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.68,0:14:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.62,0:14:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're starting to\Nsound like a real wacko.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.40,0:14:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not trying to hide the fact that\Nyou got beat by the enemy, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.72,0:14:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out with it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.38,0:15:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't see a damn thing, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.44,0:15:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.44,0:15:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, which is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.66,0:15:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really see\Nsomething or didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You picked a hell of a\Ntime to take a round.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.66,0:15:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't sense anything nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.50,0:15:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, it's\Nprobably a long-range stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.36,0:15:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you're right about that, the\Nuser must be observing from afar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.22,0:15:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, we need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.60,0:15:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling our escape\Nshould be sooner than later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.24,0:15:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The canal will take us out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.26,0:15:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.50,0:15:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The canal's waiting for us to take out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.60,0:15:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for reiterating that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.56,0:15:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.47,0:15:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.94,0:15:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you covering your mouth like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.76,0:15:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.67,0:15:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Show us whatever it is you're hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.54,0:15:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not seeing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.64,0:15:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, nothing to see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's absolutely nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.74,0:15:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.58,0:16:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what now, Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.64,0:16:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we all going to head out to sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.98,0:16:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're not heading\Ndown the canal just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our chance, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.20,0:16:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our chance to hunt down\Nand eliminate the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.28,0:16:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, the boss never saw\Nour little betrayal coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.76,0:16:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He has sentries everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.66,0:16:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's safe to say he hasn't had time\Nto mobilize all his forces. Meaning,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.52,0:16:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,if we take down this foe, we'll be able\Nto escape to the sea much more safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.98,0:16:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.89,0:16:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes a lot of sense. I'm all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.18,0:16:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you can count me in too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.30,0:16:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's all settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.46,0:16:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pucerati, we'll follow your lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.38,0:16:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Abokyo, I need you to run a replay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.84,0:16:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring out moody jazz and\Nwe'll get to work right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.32,0:16:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.23,0:16:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.15,0:16:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So where do you want to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.66,0:16:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Would when the soup was still\Non the table be a good spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.18,0:16:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.98,0:16:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the enemy's right over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.86,0:17:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean inside the restaurant's bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear, you damn well better\Nhave seen something this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.88,0:17:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.86,0:17:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get on it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.32,0:17:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll settle the fight\Nwith them here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.64,0:17:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Giorno, let's move! Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.08,0:17:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help, Naraksha.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You've played your part beautifully.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.82,0:17:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.48,0:17:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your friends have no idea my stand\Ncrush is quite a handy little helper.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.87,0:17:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,my stand talking mouth works wonders,\Nespecially when it latches onto your tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:18:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and forces you to say the exact\Nopposite of what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Match to kill isn't\Ngoing to scratch itself. Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.34,0:18:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what all this\Nwas about? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.16,0:18:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever this asshole is used me to get\Nthe guys near the water one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.18,0:18:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody mocks me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.24,0:18:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not picking up on anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to figure out\Nthis bastard's identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Moody Jess!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.50,0:18:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Transform into whoever was just in here\Nand start following their movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, finding the user with\NMoody Jazz is a great plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.92,0:18:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but you can't go after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.54,0:18:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as good as dead in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.66,0:18:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to bust my ass to keep
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.56,0:18:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,them as far as possible\Nfrom that death trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.84,0:18:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.72,0:18:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Moody Jazz is transforming into someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to get away from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.78,0:19:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.52,0:19:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.43,0:19:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over here, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.76,0:19:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't believe what's in this bowl!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.22,0:19:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.13,0:19:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You nasty little\Nget-it-together, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.12,0:19:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here, Bakkyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a present for ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.90,0:19:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Check the bowl for the surprise inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.54,0:19:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a new kind of fetish or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The only reason we're even\Nsearching this place is
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.78,0:19:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,because you were yapping\Non about seeing the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.16,0:19:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell the damn truth\Nabout what you saw!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to tell -
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.16,0:19:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.07,0:19:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.24,0:19:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ucharati, I think all of this\Nwas Narancia's imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.72,0:19:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're gonna pursue whoever's after\Nus, we should go back to the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.52,0:19:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.18,0:19:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to get a frickin' grip, Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.66,0:19:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This kind of bullshit could derail\Neverything we've worked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.02,0:20:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, your finger, it's bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.68,0:20:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you may have cut it on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.02,0:20:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, let me stop the bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.12,0:20:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Katsune, you're gonna try\Nmoving through my blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't come near me, Chorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.08,0:20:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for offering.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.42,0:20:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I know something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.58,0:20:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on inside of your mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy was messing\Naround with your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.28,0:20:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it connected?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.42,0:20:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Atta boy, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.66,0:20:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd pull through.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so close to figuring\Nthis whole thing out. Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.00,0:20:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to take care of this wound first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.12,0:20:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.96,0:20:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.87,0:20:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't touch my blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.18,0:20:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry. Stop! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.24,0:20:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.32,0:20:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Little bummer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.36,0:21:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, I haven't known you long,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.42,0:21:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can tell there's something\Nforcing you to act this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.84,0:21:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be the reason why you\Ncan't give us a straight answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.42,0:21:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.16,0:21:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You finally figured it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that stand left\Nsomething in your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.12,0:21:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That would explain all this.
